[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ## Executive Summary
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr Nuxel is a **~30% complete design scaffold and code prototype**. The design documentation and repo structure are mature (~75% complete). Core services (bridge, portal, notifications, HTTP API, Phosh agent) are well-architected in Python with real code. Native GTK4 C apps exist at skeleton level. PWA frontends have real HTML/CSS/JS with service workers and manifests. Build scripts are architectural planning material with dev stubs. The project has **not produced a flashable OS image** and has **not been tested on real mustang hardware**.
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
