[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr | SHIFT6mq, OnePlus 6/6T, POCO F1 as best repurposed Android devices | ⚠️ Nuxel chose Pixel 10 Pro XL — NOT on this list; higher risk |
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr | PWA-first, not PWA-only | ✅ Nuxel correctly scoped native apps for core phone functions |
