[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr **`images/build.sh` — 581 lines:**
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - Well-structured 7-step pipeline with proper error handling, logging, and configuration
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - Step 1 (kernel): Attempts clone from `https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/gs-mustang` — this repo may not exist or may require authentication
