[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - Step 6 (signing): References `avbtool` but the signing flow is incomplete
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - **Gap not previously captured:** The build script's kernel source URL (`android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/gs-mustang`) may be wrong — Google typically hosts kernel source at `android.googlesource.com/kernel/gs` or `android.googlesource.com/kernel/manifest`. A Google authentication requirement could block all CI automation.
