[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ### Gap S: No DNS-over-HTTPS / DNS privacy
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr The DNS config in the VM/rootfs defaults to whatever NetworkManager gets via DHCP — typically the carrier or ISP's DNS servers. A privacy-focused OS should default to DNS-over-HTTPS or DNS-over-TLS.
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
