[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ## 10.6 The Missing Integration Layer — What Connects Everything
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr The single biggest gap in the Nuxel codebase is the **integration layer** — the code that wires components together at runtime:
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ```
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr PWA (browser) ──HTTP──▶ API server ──Python──▶ Bridge ──D-Bus──▶ Portal ──D-Bus──▶ PhoshAgent (UI)
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr                                       │
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr                                       ├──D-Bus──▶ ModemManager
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr                                       ├──D-Bus──▶ NetworkManager  
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr                                       └──D-Bus──▶ GeoClue
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ```
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr Every individual component exists in isolation:
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - The PWA has `bridge.js` that makes fetch() calls
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - The API server has Flask routes that call bridge methods
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - The bridge has connector classes that make D-Bus calls
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - The portal has permission checking that delegates to PhoshAgent
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - The PhoshAgent has GTK dialogs
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr But **no one has ever run this chain end-to-end**. The integration gaps are:
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 1. **PWA → API token flow**: The PWA hardcodes a dev token; no token fetch/refresh exists
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 2. **API → Bridge fallback**: API has mock data fallbacks — if the bridge is down, the API silently returns mock data. No error is raised.
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 3. **Bridge → ModemManager**: Uses proxy calls that haven't been tested against a real modem
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 4. **Portal → PhoshAgent**: Portal blocks on D-Bus waiting for PhoshAgent response; no timeout
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 5. **PhoshAgent → D-Bus session**: Must be running in the Phosh user session; auto-start not configured
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 6. **Sandbox → App launch**: Sandbox launcher is never called by the PWA runtime
