[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr | D.1 | Pure mainline vs vendor kernel | Mainline-only / Vendor-first / Hybrid | UNRESOLVED | **Use google-android-gs-mustang-6.12 vendor kernel as Phase 0 bootstrap.** Mainline DT patches for mustang are at UART/initramfs level. Expecting a pure-mainline boot on mustang in 2026 is unrealistic. Accept vendor kernel, plan migration to mainline LTS. |
