[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr | D.3 | Init system per target | systemd-only / OpenRC-only / Both | UNRESOLVED | **Both — systemd for Fedora VM, OpenRC for Alpine/pmOS mustang.** Document each target's init expectations clearly. Remove the other init system's files from each target's install path. |
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr | D.4 | PWA runtime engine | WebKitGTK / Chromium / WPE | Chromium (dev) | **WPE WebKit for production.** Smaller footprint, better sandboxing. Chromium for development testing. |
