[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ## 11.7 The Integration Layer — The Single Largest Remaining Problem
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr Every individual component exists and is well-structured. But **nothing talks to anything else**:
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ```
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr [PWA (browser)] ───???───▶ [HTTP API (port 8080)] ───Python───▶ [Bridge (D-Bus)]
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr                                                                      │
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr [Sandbox (clone/seccomp/Landlock)] ◀───NEVER CALLED BY─── ─────────┘
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr                                                                      │
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr [nftables (cgroup rules)] ◀──────────── NEEDS CGROUPS ──────────────┘
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr The full chain should be:
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr PWA → Flatpak sandbox → localhost API → bridge → portal → PhoshAgent → user consent
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr                                                       └→ ModemManager/NetworkManager/GeoClue
