[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ## Kiosk Mode — Auto-Launch Nuxel Home Fullscreen
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr After login, Phosh auto-opens Nuxel Home in kiosk (no browser chrome):
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ```bash
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr cd ~/nuxel
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr # Install Chromium
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr sudo dnf install -y chromium
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr # Install the kiosk launcher
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr mkdir -p ~/bin
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr cp shell/nuxel-kiosk/nuxel-home-kiosk ~/bin/
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr chmod +x ~/bin/nuxel-home-kiosk
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr # Install desktop entry (appears in Phosh app drawer)
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr mkdir -p ~/.local/share/applications
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr sed "s|/home/wicked|$HOME|g" shell/config/nuxel-home.desktop   > ~/.local/share/applications/nuxel-home.desktop
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr # Install systemd user service (auto-launch on login)
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr mkdir -p ~/.config/systemd/user
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr sed "s|/home/wicked|$HOME|g" shell/config/systemd-user/nuxel-home-kiosk.service   > ~/.config/systemd/user/nuxel-home-kiosk.service
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr # Set up Wayland environment for user services
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr dbus-update-activation-environment --systemd   WAYLAND_DISPLAY DISPLAY XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP XDG_SESSION_TYPE XDG_RUNTIME_DIR
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr systemctl --user daemon-reload
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr systemctl --user enable nuxel-home-kiosk.service
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr systemctl --user restart nuxel-home-kiosk.service
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr # Test manually
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ~/bin/nuxel-home-kiosk
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ```
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr Reboot and Nuxel Home opens fullscreen automatically via systemd user service.
