[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr ## 6. Guardrails
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr 
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - Each target's init files must remain **self-consistent**.
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - Do not mix systemd units into the OpenRC image or OpenRC scripts into the
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr   systemd image.
[0m[36m[Qlarifier] stderr - On the Fedora-VM (systemd) target there is a **known contradiction** that must be
