[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr # Builds the Nuxel kernel for Google Pixel 10 Pro XL (mustang, Tensor G5) using
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr # an aarch64 cross-toolchain. This is a CI/verification job: it compiles the
