[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr # android-gs-mustang-6.12 / linux-6.12.y Kconfig tree). They have been
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr # removed so that `make olddefconfig` does not silently strip them. Where a
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr # real upstream symbol exists it is substituted (marked "replaced by").
