[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr This VM is the **Fedora ARM64 / systemd** target described in
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr **`docs/init-system.md`**. It is one of two independent deployment paths:
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr 
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr - **(A) Fedora VM → systemd** — this report.
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr - **(B) Alpine / pmOS mustang → OpenRC** — see `docs/init-system.md` §3;
