[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr | **Bootloader unlock** (`fastboot flashing unlock`) | VM has no bootloader; emulated `virt` machine has no unlock flow | `docs/bootloader-unlock-guide.md`, `docs/device-setup.md` |
