[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr ## How to Run a Full Verification Pass (checklist)
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr 
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr 1. Boot the UTM VM and confirm §2 (clean boot, correct kernel, snapshot SHA).
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr 2. Confirm the firstboot marker; if absent, the wizard is pending.
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr 3. Run §3 service checks (systemd + D-Bus + HTTP) and record `yes/no`.
