[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr // Nuxel shared Bridge Client — canonical module for all PWA frontends.
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr //
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr // This module is loaded as a plain browser script by every Nuxel PWA so that
