[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr //     `getGrantedCapabilities`, `revokeCapability`, `onCapabilityChange`,
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr //     and `getPermissionSummary` drive the nuxel-portal consent flow.  A
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr //     convenience `requestPermission(cap, reason)` helper is provided that
