[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr //
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr //   * Connectivity: exponential-backoff reconnect while the server is
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr //     unreachable, plus `on`/`off`/`_emit` for a small event bus.
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr //
