[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr # Nuxel Phone OS
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr 
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr **v0.1.0** — _Build the bunker first. Add the rave lights later._
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr 
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr A hardened, Graphene-style Linux phone operating system for the Google Pixel 10 Pro XL (mustang). Zero Android dependencies. Immutable OS. PWA-first app model. Phosh/GTK4/Wayland shell.
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr 
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr ```
[0m[35m[instruQtor] stderr PWA-first.
